></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.980" end="00:35.880"><span begin="00:28.980" end="00:29.970">We </span><span begin="00:29.970" end="00:30.750">don't </span><span begin="00:30.750" end="00:31.770">need </span><span begin="00:31.770" end="00:32.610">to </span><span begin="00:32.610" end="00:35.310">overthink </span><span begin="00:35.310" end="00:35.880">this</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.030" end="00:39.270"><span begin="00:36.030" end="00:36.900">Nothing's </span><span begin="00:36.900" end="00:37.710">gonna </span><span begin="00:37.710" end="00:38.340">bring </span><span begin="00:38.340" end="00:38.640">us </span><span begin="00:38.640" end="00:39.270">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.510" end="00:43.170"><span begin="00:39.510" end="00:40.170">Show </span><span begin="00:40.170" end="00:40.470">them </span><span begin="00:40.470" end="00:41.040">what </span><span begin="00:41.040" end="00:41.400">we're </span><span begin="00:41.400" end="00:42.090">all </span><span begin="00:42.090" end="00:43.170">about</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.290" end="00:43.950"><span begin="00:43.290" end="00:43.560">All </span><span begin="00:43.560" end="00:43.710">the </span><span begin="00:43.710" end="00:43.950">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.950" end="00:46.410"><span begin="00:43.950" end="00:44.190">One </span><span begin="00:44.190" end="00:44.610">hundred </span><span begin="00:44.610" end="00:44.820">one </span><span begin="00:44.820" end="00:45.450">percent </span><span begin="00:45.450" end="00:46.410">touchdown</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.560" end="00:47.700"><span begin="00:46.560" end="00:46.800">We're </span><span begin="00:46.800" end="00:47.190">gonna </span><span begin="00:47.190" end="00:47.550">kill </span><span begin="00:47.550" end="00:47.700">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.700" end="00:48.390"><span begin="00:47.700" end="00:47.970">Lead </span><span begin="00:47.970" end="00:48.120">the </span><span begin="00:48.120" end="00:48.390">pack</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.390" end="00:50.130"><span begin="00:48.390" end="00:48.600">Gonna </span><span begin="00:48.600" end="00:48.930">take </span><span begin="00:48.930" end="00:49.260">this </span><span begin="00:49.260" end="00:50.130">town</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.610" end="00:51.750"><span begin="00:50.610" end="00:51.210">Let's </span><span begin="00:51.210" end="00:51.750">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.810" end="00:54.210"><span begin="00:51.810" end="00:52.560">Whatcha </span><span begin="00:52.560" end="00:52.980">wanna </span><span begin="00:52.980" end="00:53.400">wait </span><span begin="00:53.400" end="00:54.060">for</span><span begin="00:54.060" end="00:54.210">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.210" end="00:57.570"><span begin="00:54.210" end="00:54.720">Let's </span><span begin="00:54.720" end="00:55.380">take </span><span begin="00:55.380" end="00:56.340">everything </span><span begin="00:56.340" end="00:56.640">we </span><span begin="00:56.640" end="00:56.970">ask </span><span begin="00:56.970" end="00:57.570">for</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.600" end="00:59.250"><span begin="00:57.600" end="00:57.930">Come </span><span begin="00:57.930" end="00:58.140">on </span><span begin="00:58.140" end="00:58.260">and </span><span begin="00:58.260" end="00:58.620">turn </span><span begin="00:58.620" end="00:58.830">it </span><span begin="00:58.830" end="00:59.250">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.400" end="01:00.900"><span begin="00:59.400" end="00:59.580">Let's </span><span begin="00:59.580" end="00:59.850">tell </span><span begin="00:59.850" end="00:59.970">the </span><span begin="00:59.970" end="01:00.330">world </span><span begin="01:00.330" end="01:00.510">we </span><span begin="01:00.510" end="01:00.900">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.900" end="01:04.650"><span begin="01:00.900" end="01:01.380">More</spa