span><span begin="01:21.660" end="01:21.900">want </span><span begin="01:21.900" end="01:24.870">more</span><span begin="01:24.870" end="01:25.530">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.530" end="01:32.460"><span begin="01:25.530" end="01:26.490">Take </span><span begin="01:26.490" end="01:27.360">my </span><span begin="01:27.360" end="01:28.410">hand </span><span begin="01:28.410" end="01:29.160">and </span><span begin="01:29.160" end="01:29.910">pull </span><span begin="01:29.910" end="01:30.810">me </span><span begin="01:30.810" end="01:32.460">closer</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.640" end="01:35.760"><span begin="01:32.640" end="01:33.330">Whisper </span><span begin="01:33.330" end="01:34.380">nothings </span><span begin="01:34.380" end="01:34.680">in </span><span begin="01:34.680" end="01:35.100">my </span><span begin="01:35.100" end="01:35.760">ears</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.120" end="01:39.360"><span begin="01:36.120" end="01:36.690">Till </span><span begin="01:36.690" end="01:36.750">the </span><span begin="01:36.750" end="01:37.380">walls </span><span begin="01:37.380" end="01:37.830">just </span><span begin="01:37.830" end="01:39.360">disappear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.390" end="01:46.530"><span begin="01:39.390" end="01:40.650">Feel </span><span begin="01:40.650" end="01:41.520">the </span><span begin="01:41.520" end="01:43.140">music </span><span begin="01:43.140" end="01:44.220">take </span><span begin="01:44.220" end="01:45.060">you </span><span begin="01:45.060" end="01:46.530">higher</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.650" end="01:49.920"><span begin="01:46.650" end="01:47.130">Feel </span><span begin="01:47.130" end="01:47.460">my </span><span begin="01:47.460" end="01:47.850">heart </span><span begin="01:47.850" end="01:48.300">beat </span><span begin="01:48.300" end="01:48.960">like </span><span begin="01:48.960" end="01:49.170">a </span><span begin="01:49.170" end="01:49.920">drum</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.160" end="01:53.820"><span begin="01:50.160" end="01:51.060">Maybe </span><span begin="01:51.060" end="01:51.660">you're </span><span begin="01:51.660" end="01:51.990">the </span><span begin="01:51.990" end="01:52.740">only </span><span begin="01:52.740" end="01:53.820">one</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.880" end="01:54.540"><span begin="01:53.880" end="01:54.150">All </span><span begin="01:54.150" end="01:54.300">the </span><span begin="01:54.300" end="01:54.540">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.540" end="01:57.000"><span begin="01:54.540" end="01:54.780">One </span><span begin="01:54.780" end="01:55.200">hundred </span><span begin="01:55.200" end="01:55.410">one </span><span begin="01:55.410" end="01:56.040">percent </span><span begin="01:56.040" end="01:57.000">touchdown</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.150" end="01:58.290"><span begin="01:57.150" end="01:57.390">We're </span><span begin="01:57.390" end="01:57.780">gonna </span><span begin="01:57.780" end="01:58.140">kill </span><span begin="01:58.140" end="01:58.290">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.290" end="01:58.980"><span begin="01:58.290" end="01:58.560">Lead </span><span begin="01:58.560" end="01:58.680">the </span><span begin="01:58.680" end="01:58.980">pack</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.980" end="02:00.600"><span begin="01:58.980" end="01:59.190">Gonna </span><span begin="01:59.190" end="01:59.520">take </span><span begin="01:59.520" end="01:59.850">this </span><span begin="01:59.850" end="02:00.600">town</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.200" end="02:02.430"><span begin="02:01.200" end="02:01.800">Let's </span><span begin="02:01.800" end="02:02.430">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.460" end="02:04.800"><span begin="02:02.460" end="02:03.150">Whatcha </span><span begin="02:03.150" end="02:03.540">wanna </span><span begin="02:03.540" end="02:03.990">wait </span><span begin="02:03.990" end="02:04.650">for</spa